["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"96. 和郎咸朋聊，自动驾驶10年演进史、关键技术细节和特斯拉 BEV Transformer VLM MPI VLA 3DGS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-03-16-zhangxiaojun-l3-不是-l2-的延长-而是-l4-的先导/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46bac62b6c4b8b63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>L3 不是 L2 的延长，而是 L4 的先导</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">理想自动驾驶团队用端到端把 200 万行代码砍到 20 万行，纵向控制第一次超过所有竞品——不是人更聪明，是终于用做能力而不是做功能的方式做自动驾驶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">端到端</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"95. 对Manus创始人肖弘的3小时访谈：世界不是线性外推，做博弈中的重要变量 Andy-Bill 定律 Agentic Yolo 模式 PMF GAIA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-03-02-zhangxiaojun-世界不是线性外推-做博弈里那个重要变量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/766e33c00e9ce2db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:22:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0302</span></div>\n<h2>世界不是线性外推：做博弈里那个重要变量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果世界是逻辑推导，今天最大的推荐引擎公司是百度。肖弘说创业者要做的不是推演必然，而是让自己成为改变博弈结果的那个变量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"94. 逐篇讲解DeepSeek、Kimi、MiniMax注意力机制新论文——“硬件上的暴力美学” NSA (Native Sparse Attention) MoBA (Mixture of Block Attention) GQA (Group Query Attention) Lightning Attention trunkwise tensor core\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-23-zhangxiaojun-deepseek-用暴力美学改架构-把-full-attention-全线压制了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e13a783fb7c67a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0223</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 用暴力美学改架构，把 Full Attention 全线压制了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">动态稀疏注意力过去只能加速推理，DeepSeek 第一次拿它从头预训练，损失曲线和下游评测全线压过 Full Attention——稀疏注意力不再只是省钱的补丁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">注意力机制</span><span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"93. 离开字节、MiniMax的张前川，发出AGI对人类威胁的预警 PageRank PGC baby AGI UBI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-20-zhangxiaojun-agi-是人类的最后一个发明-但-95-的公司在踩油门/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0671266ee01a3b9e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0220</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 是人类的最后一个发明，但 95% 的公司在踩油门</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张前川把人类文明比作开出 1 万公里的车，AGI 是最后一公里：前方可能是更宽的公路，也可能是悬崖。而绝大多数 AI 公司正在做的是疯狂踩油门。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">内容分发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"92. 和张亚勤院士聊，意识、寿命、机器人、生物智能和物种的延伸 RS2 corner case end-to-end world model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-17-zhangxiaojun-张亚勤-信息智能五年到顶-人形机器人还要十年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/af271912f6614eec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">53:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0217</span></div>\n<h2>张亚勤：信息智能五年到顶，人形机器人还要十年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把 AGI 拆成信息、物理、生物三层：信息智能五年内达到人类水平，但那是大脑的智商；读万卷书仍不会游泳，物理智能才刚开场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"91. 逐篇讲解DeepSeek关键9篇论文及创新点——“勇敢者的游戏” MoE MLA MTP FP8 PPO rule-based reward\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-11-zhangxiaojun-deepseek-用-2000-张卡训出-671b-模型-靠的是敢赌没人做过的技/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e697ec31e81cd26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:20:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0211</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 用 2000 张卡训出 671B 模型，靠的是敢赌没人做过的技术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 的每一步创新都是被成本逼出来的：从 MoE 到 MLA 到 FP8 训练，别人不敢在大规模上试的东西，他们试了，而且一次训完没回滚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"90. 朱啸虎又来了：中国现实主义AIGC故事的1周年连载 Scaling Law RL DAU PMF Capex\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-07-zhangxiaojun-朱啸虎改口-deepseek-让他快信-agi-了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd200744fc07602d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0207</span></div>\n<h2>朱啸虎改口：DeepSeek 让他快信 AGI 了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一年前他说绝不投任何一家中国大模型公司，如今他说如果梁文锋开放融资「我肯定会投」，价格已经不太重要，关键是参与见证人类 AGI 和 AI 意识的产生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"89. 逐句讲解DeepSeek-R1、Kimi K1.5、OpenAI o1技术报告——“最优美的算法最干净” GRPO reward hacking PRM MCTS distillation curriculum sampling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-04-zhangxiaojun-r1-最值钱的不是模型-是那个-aha-moment/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/acc6341cf0407e5d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:49:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0204</span></div>\n<h2>R1 最值钱的不是模型，是那个 aha moment</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 把 O1 出的谜语第一个解开了：不用人教，模型自己在强化学习里学会反思和纠错。R1-Zero 比 R1 更干净，但 R1 才是能用的那个。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"88. 和吴翼技术解读OpenAI Operator：推理从抽象世界走向物理世界的开端 CUA GUI agent close loop system OS World\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-24-zhangxiaojun-operator-不是-o3-的延续-是推理伸向物理世界的第一只手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55d0a72f1e4b0469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0124</span></div>\n<h2>Operator 不是 O3 的延续，是推理伸向物理世界的第一只手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 2016 年做 Web Agent 失败并裁掉二三十人，缺的是基座模型；十年后 Operator 把基座模型、人类数据和强化学习三件事凑齐，才让推理从抽象文本走向视觉交互。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"87. 对李想的3小时访谈（播客版）：宅男、AI、家庭、游戏和天梯 VLA VLM MPI BLM DT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-02-zhangxiaojun-李想-汽车是物理世界ai最大的应用-但l4门票要三样东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d61119d6a5d51c08-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:53:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0102</span></div>\n<h2>李想：汽车是物理世界AI最大的应用，但L4门票要三样东西</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把AI产品分三段：增强能力、成为助手、成为家人。今天连第一段都没做好，所以真正的竞争还没开始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI产品</span><span class=\"tag\">智能驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"86. 大模型季报年终特辑：和广密预言LLM产品超越Google之路 Long Horizon Task MCP Data Wall Reward Model K-Lab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-22-zhangxiaojun-下一个google不是搜索-是任务引擎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1d93d02a587ff35f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1222</span></div>\n<h2>下一个Google不是搜索，是任务引擎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ChatGPT、Anthropic、Perplexity 形态各异，但都在争夺同一件事：重新组织信息与任务。搜索和推荐融合成任务引擎，谁掌握 context 谁就赢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"85. 与总统竞选成员聊，总统候选人与美国叙事如何PMF？ Product Market Fit Voter Registration Early Voting Tracker Deregulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-15-zhangxiaojun-总统大选就是给候选人找-pmf-产品不行谁也救不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1644e0aa04895839-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">52:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1215</span></div>\n<h2>总统大选就是给候选人找 PMF，产品不行谁也救不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大选团队是短期内 scale up 最快的组织，但产品（候选人）已经定了，能做的只是把产品和整个国家的环境做 product market fit。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国大选</span><span class=\"tag\">PMF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"84. 融了近4亿的AI创业者在干嘛？岂凡超的第一次访谈 conditioned generation RAG PMF MVP Foundation Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-10-zhangxiaojun-模型公司终将消失-产品公司才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f116fd554543d82-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1210</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司终将消失，产品公司才刚开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">齐帆超认为模型本身没法直接产生价值，将来不存在模型公司；他融了近4亿却主动放弃训更大模型，转而解决大模型输出不确定性这个产品落地的最大卡点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"83. 黄仁勋和3万亿美元英伟达是如何炼成的？ CUDA Riva 128 pilot in charge Top5\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-04-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有二号位-黄仁勋退休后谁来管60个人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/775b2d2a4ded4dbf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1204</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达没有二号位：黄仁勋退休后谁来管60个人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达的战略不是规划出来的，是三个团队两个赛季、运送一整头牛这些战术被验证后固定下来的；但公司至今没有明显的二号位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"82. 和以太坊Vitalik Buterin聊：LLM的权力、技术哲学观与猫 Layer 2 Farcaster Warpcast Polymarket Worldcoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-11-25-zhangxiaojun-ai-是中心化的权力-crypto-是它的解药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ee10748c810b71-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1125</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是中心化的权力，Crypto 是它的解药</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik 说 AI 的权力来自算力和数据，最好的 AI 就是最大的 AI，天然走向中心化；Crypto 唯一的作用是解决人和人之间的信任问题，所以 AI 参与 Crypto 的游戏，而不是反过来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">Crypto</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"81. 和李开复聊聊：如果美国形成AGI霸权，我们应该怎么办？ veneer Service as Software TCPMF HBM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-11-10-zhangxiaojun-第一个做出agi的必然是垄断者-中国只能走生态这条路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f3cfaffb1fad8fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>第一个做出AGI的必然是垄断者，中国只能走生态这条路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">追求第一个碾压对手的AGI，本质是商业霸权野心——他会用这个大脑发明手段维持垄断。中国公司打不过这场烧钱游戏，只能先把推理成本降下来，用生态当护城河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI霸权</span><span class=\"tag\">推理成本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=